hadiths[4]{hadithnumber,text}:
"6","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Muhammad bin Uqail se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) Madinah tashreef laye, us waqt Umar bin Abdul Aziz (Rahimahullah) wahan ke governor the. To Umar bin Abdul Aziz ne mujhe un ke paas bheja takeh main un se us hadees ke bare mein poochun jo un tak pahunchi thi, jo Hajjaj bin Yusuf ne un logon ke bare mein bayan ki thi jo Madinah se nikle aur Madinah ke charagah janwaron par hamla kiya. To Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne lashkar talab farmaya, phir un ke taaqub mein dastah bheja, aur unhon ne un mein se chhe afrad ko pakad liya. [Hajjaj ka] khayal tha ke Aap ne un mein se do ko sooli di, do ke [hath paon] kate, aur do ki [aankhon mein garam salakhon se] chhed kiya. Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha: 'Wo log pehle Islam ka iqrar kar chuke the aur hijrat karke Madinah mein reh rahe the, phir wo Islam se nafrat karke nikle aur dushman se ja mile, is liye un ke haq mein [ye saza] halal hui.' [Rawi ne] kaha: To Umar bin Abdul Aziz ne mujhe dobara un [Anas] ke paas bheja, phir unhon ne kaha: 'Kash tum ye hadees Hajjaj ko na sunate. Beshak Aap ne ye us qaum ke sath kiya jo Islam se nikal kar shirk se ja mili thi, is liye un ke haq mein ye halal hua. Jabke Hajjaj ne ye un logon ke haq mein halal samjha jo na Islam se nikle aur na shirk se ja mile.' [Rawi ne] kaha: Aur Umar bin Abdul Aziz ne mujhe hukm diya ke un [Anas] se poochun ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) mehndi se [baalon ko] kis cheez se rangte the. To Anas ne kaha: Beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) kale baalon [ki nemat] se nawaze gaye the; agar tum Aap ke sar aur dadhi ke [safaid baal] gino to bees safed baalon se zyada na honge' — ya unhon ne kaha: 'Tum Aap ke baalon mein dus safed baal bhi na paoge.' Aur [is hadees ke] alfaz Abu Yusuf ke hain."
"7","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai: Beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) logon ko namaz padha rahe the, phir un ke samne se ek gadha guzra. To Ayyash bin Abi Rabiah ne kaha: 'Subhanallahi wa bihamdihi [Allah pak hai aur Usi ki hamd ke sath].' Jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne salam phera to farmaya: 'Abhi Subhanallahi wa bihamdihi keh kar tasbeeh kis ne ki?' [Ayyash ne] kaha: Main ne, Ya Rasulullah. Beshak main ne suna tha ke gadha namaz tod deta hai. Aap ne farmaya: 'Koi cheez namaz nahin todti.'"
"8","[AI-translation] Shaikh Abul Husain Al-Hafiz Muhammad bin Al-Muzaffar ne kaha: Muhammad bin Musa Al-Hadrami ne hamen bayan kiya, Ibrahim bin Munqiz ne hamen bayan kiya, Idrees bin Yahya ne hamen bayan kiya, phir unhon ne apni sanad se isi ki manind [jaisa pichli hadees mein hai] zikr kiya."
"9","[AI-translation] Ayyash bin Abi Rabiah Makhzumi se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ek din apne sahaba ko namaz padha rahe the to achanak hamare samne se ek gadha guzra. To Ayyash ne kaha: 'Subhanallah.' Jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) [namaz se] farigh hue to farmaya: 'Tum mein se kis ne tasbeeh ki?' Ayyash ne kaha: Main ne, Ya Rasulullah. Main ne suna tha ke gadha namaz tod deta hai. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Koi cheez namaz nahin todti.'"
